 one of the most admired qualities in any being — human or animal. Naming your pet after courage gives them an identity of bravery from day one. Whether for a rescue pet who overcame hardship or a naturally bold companion, these names carry deep meaning. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",\"$L23\",\", \",\"$L24\",\", and \",\"$L25\",\" name collections.\"]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\",\"$L32\"]}],\"$L33\",\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\",\"$L38\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"306\",{\"href\":\"/animal/marsupial-mole/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Marsupial Mole\",\" Name Generator\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"324\",{\"href\":\"/animal/paca/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Paca\",\" Name Generator\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"336\",{\"href\":\"/animal/sea-bunny/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Sea Bunny\",\" Name Generator\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Greek & Latin Courage Names\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Andreas</strong> (manly, brave), <strong>Valentina</strong> (strong, courageous), <strong>Thaddeus</strong> (courageous heart), <strong>Ari</strong> (lion, brave). <strong>Leon</strong> or <strong>Leo</strong> means lion — the universal symbol of courage. For more naming inspiration, explore our {portuguese-water-dog}, {indian-pangolin}, and {mandarinfish} name collections.\"}}]\n28:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Warrior & Hero Names\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Boudica</strong> (warrior queen), <strong>Leonidas</strong> (Spartan king), <strong>Achilles</strong> (Greek hero), <strong>Joan</strong> (of Arc), <strong>Samurai</strong>, <strong>Ranger</strong>, <strong>Trooper</strong>, <strong>Gladiator</strong>. For more naming inspiration, explore our {ringtail}, {boomslang}, and {abyssinian-cat} name collections.\"}}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Global Courage Names\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Shura</strong> (Arabic for bravery), <strong>Yong</strong> (Chinese for brave), <strong>Isamu</strong> (Japanese for courage), <strong>Bali</strong> (Sanskrit for strength), <strong>Koa</strong> (Hawaiian for brave). For more naming inspiration, explore our {coelacanth}, {eclectus-parrot}, and {pronghorn} name collections.\"}}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Animal Names That Mean Brave\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Explore our name generators for \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"32\",{\"href\":\"/animal/anthias/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Anthias\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"43\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-grey-parrot/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Grey Parrot\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"66\",{\"href\":\"/animal/algae-octopus/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Algae Octopus\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"83\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-wild-dog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Wild Dog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"107\",{\"href\":\"/animal/alpaca/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Alpaca\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Animals associated with bravery: <strong>Lion</strong>, <strong>Eagle</strong>, <strong>Hawk</strong>, <strong>Bear</strong>, <strong>Wolf</strong>, <strong>Tiger</strong>, <strong>Falcon</strong>. Simply naming your pet after these animals conveys courage. For more naming inspiration, explore our {lop-rabbit}, {bengal-tiger}, and {frogmouth} name collections.\"}}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Real-World Example: From Shelter Survivor to 'Valor'\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"When Marcus adopted a three-legged pit bull who had survived a car accident and months in a shelter, he knew the name had to mean something powerful. 'I considered Rocky, Survivor, Champion — but Valor felt different,' he recalls. 'It wasn't just about surviving. It was about facing every new day with courage despite everything he'd been through.' Two years later, Marcus volunteers at the same shelter where he found Valor, and his dog's name — and story — inspires every new adopter he meets. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"538\",{\"href\":\"/animal/hornbill/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Hornbill\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"550\",{\"href\":\"/animal/jack-russell-terrier/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Jack Russell Terrier\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"578\",{\"href\":\"/animal/chameleon/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Chameleon\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"p\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"This is the true power of a courage-based name: it doesn't just describe your pet — it can inspire action, spark conversations, and become part of a larger story about resilience and hope. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"230\",{\"href\":\"/animal/european-brown-bear/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"European Brown Bear\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"253\",{\"href\":\"/animal/atlantic-puffin/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Atlantic Puffin\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"276\",{\"href\":\"/animal/limpkin/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Limpkin\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Discover more naming inspiration: \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"34\",{\"href\":\"/animal/eurasian-eagle-owl/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Eurasian Eagle-Owl\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"56\",{\"href\":\"/animal/peregrine-falcon/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Peregrine Falcon\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"76\",{\"href\":\"/animal/prairie-dog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Prairie Dog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"91\",{\"href\":\"/animal/spiny-orb-weaver/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Spiny Orb Weaver\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"111\",{\"href\":\"/animal/japanese-bobtail/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Japanese Bobtail\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"131\",{\"href\":\"/animal/oriental-shorthair/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Oriental Shorthair\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"153\",{\"href\":\"/animal/fairy-basslet/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Fairy Basslet\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"170\",{\"href\":\"/animal/green-aracari/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Green Aracari\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"187\",{\"href\":\"/animal/moon-wrasse/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Moon Wrasse\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"202\",{\"href\":\"/animal/bongo/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Bongo\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and hundreds more animal name generators at BestAnimalNames.com.\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Why name a pet after courage?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Especially meaningful for rescue animals, pets who've overcome illness, or naturally protective companions. It honors their spirit.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What's the most popular courage pet name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Leo (lion) is by far the most popular courage-inspired pet name, followed by Brave, Hero, and Valor.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What cultures have the strongest tradition of courage-based animal names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Norse and Germanic cultures have a particularly rich tradition of courage-based naming — names like Thor, Odin, Valkyrie, and Bjorn (bear) reflect warrior values. Japanese culture offers samurai-inspired names like Takeshi (warrior) and Isamu (brave). Celtic traditions provide names like Conall (strong wolf) and Brianna (noble, strong). Across cultures, courage-related names signal respect and admiration for the animal bearing them.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can a courageous name actually influence how people perceive my pet?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes — name stereotyping is a well-documented psychological phenomenon. A dog named 'Valor' is perceived as braver and more protective than one named 'Fluffy,' even with identical behavior. This has practical implications: at the vet, at dog parks, and with new people, a name that conveys strength can shape first impressions positively for larger or more powerful breeds.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Are there subtle courage names for shy or small pets?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely. Not every courage name needs to be bold and loud. Consider gentle-but-strong names like Sage (wisdom is courage), Pax (peace requires bravery), Rune (mystery and power), or Fable (stories of heroism). These names convey quiet strength and can perfectly suit a shy cat, a small dog, or a gentle rabbit who shows courage in their own way.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are good courage names for rescue animals?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Rescue pets have already demonstrated real courage by surviving whatever circumstances brought them to you. Names like Phoenix (rising from ashes), Survivor, Chance, Journey, and Valor honor that resilience. Champion, Rocky, and Victor celebrate their fighting spirit. These names tell your pet's story and honor their past while celebrating their present.\"}]]}],\"$L39\"]}]]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"lion\",{\"href\":\"/animal/lion/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦁\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Lion\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"wolf\",{\"href\":\"/animal/wolf/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children