2\",\"children\":\"Best Animal Names for Exotic Pets: Unique Ideas for Rare Companions 🦎\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Naming an exotic pet requires special creativity. From reptiles and amphibians to sugar gliders and hedgehogs, discover perfectly unique names for your rare companion.\"}]]}]\n1a:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n17:null\n1c:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave & Bold Ideas 🦁\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Give your pet a name that embodies bravery. Discover names from mythology, history, and world languages that literally mean courage, bravery, and valor.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"courage names, brave names, bold names, valor names\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"p:domain_verify\",\"content\":\"acc18c9aa2855ead49c874b6cac9cb61\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"6\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/animal-names-that-mean-courage/\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave & Bold Ideas 🦁\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Give your pet a name that embodies bravery. Discover names from mythology, history, and world languages that literally mean courage, bravery, and valor.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave & Bold Ideas 🦁\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Give your pet a name that embodies bravery. Discover names from mythology, history, and world languages that literally mean courage, bravery, and valor.\"}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n9:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"\"]\n20:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n21:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2:T1033,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave & Bold Ideas 🦁\",\"description\":\"Give your pet a name that embodies bravery. Discover names from mythology, history, and world languages that literally mean courage, bravery, and valor.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-18\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-06\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/animal-names-that-mean-courage/\"},\"wordCount\":394,\"articleBody\":\" Courage is one of the most admired qualities in any being — human or animal. Naming your pet after courage gives them an identity of bravery from day one. Whether for a rescue pet who overcame hardship or a naturally bold companion, these names carry deep meaning. For more naming inspiration, explore our {marsupial-mole}, {paca}, and {sea-bunny} name collections. Greek & Latin Courage Names <strong>Andreas</strong> (manly, brave), <strong>Valentina</strong> (strong, courageous), <strong>Thaddeus</strong> (courageous heart), <strong>Ari</strong> (lion, brave). <strong>Leon</strong> or <strong>Leo</strong> means lion — the universal symbol of courage. For more naming inspiration, explore our {portuguese-water-dog}, {indian-pangolin}, and {mandarinfish} name collections. Warrior & Hero Names <strong>Boudica</strong> (warrior queen), <strong>Leonidas</strong> (Spartan king), <strong>Achilles</strong> (Greek hero), <strong>Joan</strong> (of Arc), <strong>Samurai</strong>, <strong>Ranger</strong>, <strong>Trooper</strong>, <strong>Gladiator</strong>. For more naming inspiration, explore our {ringtail}, {boomslang}, and {abyssinian-cat} name collections. Global Courage Names <strong>Shura</strong> (Arabic for bravery), <strong>Yong</strong> (Chinese for brave), <strong>Isamu</strong> (Japanese for courage), <strong>Bali</strong> (Sanskrit for strength), <strong>Koa</strong> (Hawaiian for brave). For more naming inspiration, explore our {coelacanth}, {eclectus-parrot}, and {pronghorn} name collections. Animal Names That Mean Brave Explore our name generators for {anthias}, {african-grey-parrot}, {algae-octopus}, {african-wild-dog}, and {alpaca} to find the perfect name for your companion. Animals associated with bravery: <strong>Lion</strong>, <strong>Eagle</strong>, <strong>Hawk</strong>, <strong>Bear</strong>, <strong>Wolf</strong>, <strong>Tiger</strong>, <strong>Falcon</strong>. Simply naming your pet after these animals conveys courage. For more naming inspiration, explore our {lop-rabbit}, {bengal-tiger}, and {frogmouth} name collections. Real-World Example: From Shelter Survivor to 'Valor' When Marcus adopted a three-legged pit bull who had survived a car accident and months in a shelter, he knew the name had to mean something powerful. 'I considered Rocky, Survivor, Champion — but Valor felt different,' he recalls. 'It wasn't just about surviving. It was about facing every new day with courage despite everything he'd been through.' Two years later, Marcus volunteers at the same shelter where he found Valor, and his dog's name — and story — inspires every new adopter he meets. For more naming inspiration, explore our {hornbill}, {jack-russell-terrier}, and {chameleon} name collections. This is the true power of a courage-based name: it doesn't just describe your pet — it can inspire action, spark conversations, and become part of a larger story about resilience and hope. For more naming inspiration, explore our {european-brown-bear}, {atlantic-puffin}, and {limpkin} name collections. Discover more naming inspiration: {eurasian-eagle-owl}, {peregrine-falcon}, {prairie-dog}, {spiny-orb-weaver}, {japanese-bobtail}, {oriental-shorthair}, {fairy-basslet}, {green-aracari}, {moon-wrasse}, {bongo}, and hundreds more animal name generators at BestAnimalNames.com.\",\"image\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-animal-names-that-mean-courage.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],null,\"$L7\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"Vn-m7ZnH220y8-FGOgPuM\"}\n8:Tc23,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why name a pet after courage?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Especially meaningful for rescue animals, pets who've overcome illness, or naturally protective companions. It honors their spirit.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What's the most popular courage pet name?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Leo (lion) is by far the most popular courage-inspired pet name, followed by Brave, Hero, and Valor.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What cultures have the strongest tradition of courage-based animal names?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Norse and Germanic cultures have a particularly rich tradition of courage-based naming — names like Thor, Odin, Valkyrie, and Bjorn (bear) reflect warrior values. Japanese culture offers samurai-inspired names like Takeshi (warrior) and Isamu (brave). Celtic traditions provide names like Conall (strong wolf) and Brianna (noble, strong). Across cultures, courage-related names signal respect and admiration for the animal bearing them.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can a courageous name actually influence how people perceive my pet?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — name stereotyping is a well-documented psychological phenomenon. A dog named 'Valor' is perceived as braver and more protective than one named 'Fluffy,' even with identical behavior. This has practical implications: at the vet, at dog parks, and with new people, a name that conveys strength can shape first impressions positively for larger or more powerful breeds.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are there subtle courage names for shy or small pets?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely. Not every courage name needs to be bold and loud. Consider gentle-but-strong names like Sage (wisdom is courage), Pax (peace requires bravery), Rune (mystery and power), or Fable (stories of heroism). These names convey quiet strength and can perfectly suit a shy cat, a small dog, or a gentle rabbit who shows courage in their own way.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are good courage names for rescue animals?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Rescue pets have already demonstrated real courage by surviving whatever circumstances brought them to you. Names like Phoenix (rising from ashes), Survivor, Chance, Journey, and Valor honor that resilience. Champion, Rocky, and Victor celebrate their fighting spirit. These names tell your pet's story and honor their past while celebrating their present.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I know if a courage name fits my pet's personality?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Observe your pet for a few days. Does your cat fearlessly explore every corner? Does your small dog stand up to bigger dogs at the park? Does your rescue pet show remarkable trust despite their past? Courage manifests differently in every animal. Match the name to the specific kind of bravery you observe — whether it's boldness, resilience, quiet confidence, or protective instinct.\"}}]}3:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$8\"}}]\n4:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Blog\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave & Bold Ideas 🦁\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/animal-names-that-mean-courage/\\\"}]}\"}}]\n5:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\",\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Home\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"/\"}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"/\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-800 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave & Bold Ideas 🦁\"}]]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-6xl mb-4\",\"children\":\"🦁\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Naming Tips\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"2026-06-18\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-500\",\"children\":\"By BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave & Bold Ideas 🦁\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\",\"children\":\"Give your pet a name that embodies bravery. Discover names from mythology, history, and world languages that literally mean courage, bravery, and valor.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"courage names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"courage names\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"brave names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"brave names\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"bold names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"bold names\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"valor names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"valor names\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-lg max-w-none\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\",\"children\":\"📋 Table of Contents\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-2 list-none pl-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[1,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#greek\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Greek & Latin Courage Names\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[2,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#warriors\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Warrior & Hero Names\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[3,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#global\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Global Courage Names\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[4,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#animals\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Animal Names That Mean Brave\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[5,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#faq\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"FAQ\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Courage is one of the most admired qualities in any being — human or animal. Naming your pet after courage gives them an identity of bravery from day one. Whether for a rescue pet who overcame hardship or a naturally bold companion, these names carry deep meaning. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",\"$La\",\", \",\"$Lb\",\", and \",\"$Lc\",\" name collections.\"]}],\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\"]}],\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$21\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@22\"}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"306\",{\"href\":\"/animal/marsupial-mole/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Marsupial Mole\",\" Name Generator\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"324\",{\"href\":\"/animal/paca/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Paca\",\" Name Generator\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"336\",{\"href\":\"/animal/sea-bunny/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Sea Bunny\",\" Name Generator\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Greek & Latin Courage Names\"]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Andreas</strong> (manly, brave), <strong>Valentina</strong> (strong, courageous), <strong>Thaddeus</strong> (courageous heart), <strong>Ari</strong> (lion, brave). <strong>Leon</strong> or <strong>Leo</strong> means lion — the universal symbol of courage. For more naming inspiration, explore our {portuguese-water-dog}, {indian-pangolin}, and {mandarinfish} name collections.\"}}]\nf:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Warrior & Hero Names\"]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Boudica</strong> (warrior queen), <strong>Leonidas</strong> (Spartan king), <strong>Achilles</strong> (Greek hero), <strong>Joan</strong> (of Arc), <strong>Samurai</strong>, <strong>Ranger</strong>, <strong>Trooper</strong>, <strong>Gladiator</strong>. For more naming inspiration, explore our {ringtail}, {boomslang}, and {abyssinian-cat} name collections.\"}}]\n11:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Global Courage Names\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Shura</strong> (Arabic for bravery), <strong>Yong</strong> (Chinese for brave), <strong>Isamu</strong> (Japanese for courage), <strong>Bali</strong> (Sanskrit for strength), <strong>Koa</strong> (Hawaiian for brave). For more naming inspiration, explore our {coelacanth}, {eclectus-parrot}, and {pronghorn} name collections.\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Animal Names That Mean Brave\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Explore our name generators for \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"32\",{\"href\":\"/animal/anthias/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Anthias\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"43\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-grey-parrot/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Grey Parrot\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"66\",{\"href\":\"/animal/algae-octopus/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Algae Octopus\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"83\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-wild-dog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Wild Dog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"107\",{\"href\":\"/animal/alpaca/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Alpaca\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Animals associated with bravery: <strong>Lion</strong>, <strong>Eagle</strong>, <strong>Hawk</strong>, <strong>Bear</strong>, <strong>Wolf</strong>, <strong>Tiger</strong>, <strong>Falcon</strong>. Simply naming your pet after these animals conveys courage. For more naming inspiration, explore our {lop-rabbit}, {bengal-tiger}, and {frogmouth} name collections.\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Real-World Example: From Shelter Survivor to 'Valor'\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"When Marcus adopted a three-legged pit bull who had survived a car accident and months in a shelter, he knew the name had to mean something powerful. 'I considered Rocky, Survivor, Champion — but Valor felt different,' he recalls. 'It wasn't just about surviving. It was about facing every new day with courage despite everything he'd been through.' Two years later, Marcus volunteers at the same shelter where he found Valor, and his dog's name — and story — inspires every new adopter he meets. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"538\",{\"href\":\"/animal/hornbill/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Hornbill\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"550\",{\"href\":\"/animal/jack-russell-terrier/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Jack Russell Terrier\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"578\",{\"href\":\"/animal/chameleon/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Chameleon\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":